cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you refer to results published on DeepECG-Bench, cite the DeepECG-Kit software and give the
  results date and library version shown at the foot of the page, which identify the numbers
  you read.
title: "DeepECG-Bench"
abstract: >-
  The architectures registered in DeepECG-Kit and their benchmark results on every task, as a
  single page drawn from three published data files.
